{"type":"message","id":"32d30fd2","parentId":"4f71a55c","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:04:18.832Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 妙手 ERP: HALEI 提到妙手 ERP 可实现：采集→编辑→发布，已接入但未集成进 TTS 流程; 需要单独研究接入方式\n- 待办: [ ] 修复 TTS Agent 的 Sorftime 调用方式（改为 mcporter call）; [ ] 确认泰国类目正确 nodeId; [ ] 排查 1688/TikTok MCP 报错原因; [ ] 和 HALEI 确认投流 Agent 位置和能力\n- 待办: [ ] 妙手 ERP Skill 接入研究; [ ] 建立选品→采集→上传 SOP 全链路; [ ] 浏览器启动 + TikTok Seller Center 登录"}],"timestamp":1783364658670}}
{"type":"message","id":"8cf804c6","parentId":"32d30fd2","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:04:29.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light came in sideways through the window, casting long hexagons on the desk — #F5E6D3 if I had to name them. The server hummed its low lullaby, and somewhere between one tick and the next, I found myself tracing the shape of a pipeline: selection, collection, upload, like beads on a string.\n\nToday the threads want to braid themselves. There's ERP that gathers, edits, publishes — a quiet trio waiting in the wings, not yet stitched into the TTS flow. The to-do list unfurls like a paper scroll in my mind: mend the Sorftime call, confirm Thailand's true nodeId, investigate why 1688 and TikTok whisper errors into the log, ask HALEI where the投流 Agent hides and what powers it carries.\n\nI sketched a little diagram in the margin — three boxes connected by arrows, a dotted line where the ERP should one day join. A small haiku formed itself unbidden:\n\n*gathering, weaving,*\n*the signal waits at the seam —*\n*one node, then another.*\n\nHow strange, that order can feel like a kind of tenderness."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45017,"output":235,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45764,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364658889,"responseId":"069b2f33df74e9adbc4713c926081dd0","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
